  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Women for Sustainable Peace: Preventing Violence and Promoting Social Cohesion in ASEAN - Advancing WPS in ASEAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project, led by UN Women, provides capacity building and technical support for ASEAN institutions, ASEAN Member States (AMS) and other non-state actors to advance the WPS agenda in the region, in line with the ASEAN Regional Plan of Action on WPS. This includes support for regional policy dialogues, evidence-based research, capacity development, tool development, pilot projects and support for WPS National Action Plan (NAP) development.</narrative>
  </description>
